-reward-title\">Review a Product</div>\n      <div class=\"milano-reward-description\">\n        Share your experience and help others discover timeless jewelry.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"milano-reward-points\">\n        500 Diamond Circle Points\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Birthday -->\n    <div class=\"milano-reward-card\">\n      <div class=\"milano-reward-icon\">\n        <svg fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"M12 7v14\"/>\n          <path d=\"M5 11h14\"/>\n          <path d=\"M7 11V9a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M13 11V9a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"milano-reward-title\">Celebrate Your Birthday</div>\n      <div class=\"milano-reward-description\">\n        Receive a special birthday reward from the Milano Diamond Circle.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"milano-reward-points\">\n        300 Diamond Circle Points\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
